---
import RankingBoard from './RankingBoard.astro';import {referenceRank} from '../data/selection';const top=referenceRank('budget').slice(0,3);
---
<section class="selection-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">RANK BY A CLEAR RULE</span><h2>先看比较口径，<br/>再看参考序位。</h2><p>月付费用、固定用量与标称单位成本，分别回答不同问题。</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/recommend/">按你的用量筛选 ↗</a></section><div class="notice">本页采用用户指定来源 <a href="https://jichangblog.org/compare/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jichangblog.org</a> 的第三方套餐资料（来源记录 2026.10.03，本站导入 2026.10.12）。不确认实时售价，不计优惠；只比较金额与容量，不提供性能排名。</div><nav class="ranking-tabs" aria-label="排行榜分类"><a href="/ranking/budget/" aria-current="page">低预算月付榜 ↗</a><a href="/ranking/overall/">200GB 需求参考榜 ↗</a><a href="/ranking/value/">标称单位成本榜 ↗</a><a href="/ranking/stable/">稳定性测试进度 ↗</a></nav><div class="rank-podium">{top.map(r=><a href={`/airport/${r.b.slug}/`}><span>月付价格 · {r.rank===3?'并列 ':''}{r.rank.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{r.b.name}</h3><strong>¥{r.p.price}<small> / 月</small></strong><p>{r.p.trafficGB}GB/月 · {r.p.name}</p></a>)}</div><div class="section-head selection-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">MONTHLY PRICE / CNY</span><h2>低预算月付参考榜</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/ranking/budget/">查看完整比较依据 ↗</a></div><RankingBoard kind="budget"/>


